{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":45,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華給巴錄的許諾"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["猶大王約西亞的兒子約雅敬第四年，尼利亞的兒子巴錄將先知耶利米口中所說的話寫在書上。耶利米說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「巴錄啊，耶和華－以色列的上帝說："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["巴錄",{"noteId":45},"曾說：『哀哉！耶和華將憂愁加在我的痛苦上，我因唉哼而困乏，不得安歇。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你要這樣告訴他，耶和華如此說：我所建立的，我必拆毀；我所栽植的，我必拔出；在全地我都如此行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你為自己圖謀大事嗎？不要圖謀！我必使災禍臨到凡有血氣的。但你無論往哪裏去，我必使你以自己的命為掠物。這是耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":45,"caller":"-","text":"原文是你","reference":{"chapter":45,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/45.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/46.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/44.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}